    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn & Associates are delighted to present this superb extended three bedroom family home with attic conversion to the open market for sale. Ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Allendale development in Clonsilla, this impressive property has been extensively upgraded and extended by the current owners and is presented in excellent condition throughout.\n\nOffering bright, spacious and contemporary accommodation, the property has been thoughtfully enhanced to provide an exceptional modern family home. Of particular note, the heating system has been upgraded, with the boiler and all radiators throughout the house replaced, while both bathrooms have also been recently upgraded. The property further benefits from triple-glazed windows and a B energy rating, enhancing both its energy efficiency and year round comfort.\n\nAccommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall and a comfortable front living room, providing a separate and cosy retreat. The standout feature of the home is the exceptional rear extension, which transforms the ground floor into a stunning, light filled open plan kitchen, dining and living space. Designed with modern family living and entertaining in mind, this impressive room is flooded with natural light and enjoys a seamless connection with the rear garden. The sense of space and brightness is immediately striking, creating a warm yet sophisticated environment for both everyday family life and entertaining.The kitchen is stylish, practical and finished to a high standard, with generous storage, excellent workspace and a contemporary finish. \n\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a generous master bedroom with ensuite, together with the recently upgraded family bathroom. The converted attic further enhances the property`s versatility and provides an excellent additional space suitable for a variety of uses, subject to the necessary requirements.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front and a private, low maintenance rear garden with artificial grass. The garden complements the rear extension perfectly, providing a natural continuation of the impressive indoor living space.\n\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a stylish, turnkey family home that has benefited from a substantial programme of upgrades and improvements. The combination of the impressive rear extension, converted attic, upgraded heating system, replacement boiler and radiators, recently upgraded bathrooms, triple glazed windows and B energy rating makes this a particularly appealing home for those seeking modern comfort, generous living space and energy efficiency.\n\nThe property is superbly located in this mature and much sought-after area of Clonsilla, with an abundance of amenities close by, including local shops, primary and secondary schools, recreational parks and sporting facilities. There is also an excellent public transport service providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre, approximately 25 minutes door to door.\n\nThe property is within easy reach of the villages of Clonee, Ongar and Blanchardstown, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, Hansfield Train Station, Dublin 15`s extensive corporate parks, the Phoenix Park, the National Aquatic Centre, the N3/M50 motorway network and Dublin International Airport.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the exceptional standard, generous accommodation and extensive upgrades this wonderful home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.7m (5'7\") x 6.14m (20'2\")\nwith premium 12mm laminate wood floor, alarm panel, ceiling coving, soft touch smart storage, separate understair storage press & feature wall panelling.\n\nLounge - 3.51m (11'6\") x 5m (16'5\")\nwith premium 12mm laminate wood floor & ceiling coving. Double doors to....\n\nKitchen / Diningroom\nwith a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback. All appliances included in sale (integrated double oven, hob, extractor, dishwasher, washing machine & American style fridge). Island unit with seating area. Premium 12mm laminate wood floor, Velux windws, recessed lighting & French doors to rear garden.\n\nLanding - 2.09m (6'10\") x 3.77m (12'4\")\nwith laminate wood floor, feature wall panelling, hotpress & recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.75m (9'0\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nto rear of house with laminate wood floor & built in sliderobes.\n\nEnsuite - 2.52m (8'3\") x 1.32m (4'4\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b. with vanity unit & shower cubicle with electric / pumped shower. Laminate floor & partially tiled walls. Heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.1m (10'2\") x 3.9m (12'10\")\nto front of house with laminate wood floor.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.62m (8'7\") x 2.11m (6'11\")\nto front of house with laminate wood floor.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.8m (5'11\") x 2.06m (6'9\")\nwith w.c., double w.h.b. with vanity unit & large shower cubicle with electric shower. Heated towel rail. Tiled floor & partially tiled walls.\n\nLanding - 1.79m (5'10\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\nwith laminate wood floor, access to eaves & velux window.\n\nAttic Conversion - 4.44m (14'7\") x 4.1m (13'5\")\nwith laminate wood floor, storage to eaves, recessed lighting & velux windows.\n\n"
